g extended mental focus, strength, and endurance when performing any physical activity."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Each serving of 24K Strength Formula contains over 2 mg of genuine 24 karat (24K) gold"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Made with real gold flakes"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Sugar-free"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Electrolytes"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Power\nFocus\nEndurance\nEnergy"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"No banned substances, 100% approved."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Creatine Magna Power is a registered trademark of Albion Labs"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: Consume 30 minutes before you train. Add one serving (1 scoop) to 12-16 fluid ounces of cold water. Stir or shake well before using."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Warning: Do not exceed recommended dose. Not intended for use by persons with a medical condition."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"This product contains caffeine."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"This product contains caffeine. Avoid additional consumption of caffeine, which may intensify adverse effects."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Consult a physician before using this product if you are pregnant, or nursing, or taking any medication. Do not use if you have high blood pressure or heart problems or are contemplating becoming pregnant."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store at 15-30(0) (59-86(0))\nProtect from heat, light and moisture."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","no